{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"search"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"搜索"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"meta"},3]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>通过以下 Google 搜索框可以搜索单纯百科的页面.</p>\n<p>2026-04-02: 这个搜索目前似乎有问题, 直接搜某些页面的标题都搜不到.</p>\n<script async src=\"https://cse.google.com/cse.js?cx=26b04124c4b5c43f9\">\n</script>\n<div class=\"gcse-search\"></div>"}}